":4,"created_at":"2026-02-20T16:04:31Z","updated_at":"2026-02-21T18:27:23Z","closed_at":"2026-02-21T18:23:05Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116541","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116541","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116541.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116541.patch","merged_at":"2026-02-21T18:23:05Z"},"body":"- Helps address #111218 \r\n\r\nSome preparation work for `variant.h` include optimizations. Also directly helps address #111218 by reducing the number of `paged_allocator.h` includes (which is admittedly not _that_ expensive).\r\n\r\nThe cost of `variant.h` is in how it includes basically all of its components.\r\nIf we want to address this, we will need to abstract away some of its interfaces into binding headers.\r\nThis is not possible as long as the variant pools depend on some types for its unions.\r\n\r\nThis PR also prepares for https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/11797 by improving abstraction around variant pool allocation.\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repit